#22400
Azar - Description room~
This is a relatively small area describing the area surrounding a small
colony of followers to the mad prophet Doomsbringer. He has taken his refuge
into the sunken city of Azar.  Made by Dixie on Ravenmud, 1998  Apart from
Doomsbringer himself no mobs here should pose no problem for a group using
sanc. What makes doomsbringer special is that he will summon back people
recalling and then if he succeeds he'll switch target to that person. Nasty
for those trying to get away...
